              "localizedDescription": "#### This is release for:\n  - version: \"0.6.4-20260818.28+84c18aa2\"\n  - revision: \"84c18aa2\"\n  - timestamp: \"Tue Aug 18 17:05:55 2026\"\n\n#### What's Changed:\n- Merge pull request #21 from The-Big-Mini/MiniStoreFork\n- fix(naming): stop overriding CFBundleDisplayName so stock iLoader finds the app\n\n#### Full Changelog: [e6f1b9f4...84c18aa2](https://github.com/The-Big-Mini/MiniStore/compare/e6f1b9f408eb8d5e474c2f7123cf513b74a2e13f...84c18aa2e0b03d42f59bb23b27e471f31f9ac436)\n",
